"P3578330093" "Uh, yeah... <em>The, Clockwork King? I sort of, um, called for his help. <em>I know, I know, but I panicked, and he's always been nice to me. <em>He's just, well, kind of crazy... <em>and obsessive... <em>and blames superheroes for everything that's gone wrong for him, <em>but he's really a nice guy. When he's calm, <em>and he's not calm right now. <em>So, I'm like really REALLY sorry, okay?"

