// Dialog :
"P2705522500" "<color deepskyblue>LADY GREY TASKFORCE:  'The Horsemen Four' <br>Part: Two</color><br><br>Your magnificent triumph this day has granted a great reprieve for all.<br><br><color orange>Our agents have found the location the captured psychics</color>. The Rikti Lineage of War holds them against their will. We must strike now, {TaskForceName}!"

