// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2996003581" "<color deepskyblue>LADY GREY TASKFORCE:  'The Dragon'<br>Part: Three<br><br></color>The Rikti have been kidnapping latent human psychics in order to utilize their energies to re-stabilize the portal between our world and their own. <br><br>They must be prevented in this, for if they should succeed they will be able to muster the full force of their military might against us. Now is the time to stop this plan before it may grow bitter fruit by <color orange>recovering the captured psychics!</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P3492533101" "Save Captured Psychics"
// SendOffString :
"P1060959831" "<color deepskyblue>LADY GREY TASKFORCE:  'The Dragon'<br>Part: Three<br><br></color>Our scouts have located the lair where the foe makes these infernal studies. Your objective shall be to infiltrate this location, recover the captured psychics, and terminate the studies of the Lineage of War's Chief Researcher in this field, a former human now known as <color red>Dra'Gon</color>. <br><br>Be vigilant, do not allow harm to come to your charges, and know that Our hopes go with you!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2961738494" "<color deepskyblue>LADY GREY TASKFORCE:  'The Dragon'<br>Part: Three<br><br></color>You are to recover all of those you can, and undo the work of this '<color red>Dragon</color>' fellow. If 2 or more of your charges fall, it shall be a dark day indeed."

