// SayOnRescue :
"P3516758971" "I'm sure my sister Infernia has already talked your ear off, <em>so I'll keep it simple: <em>We're with the Omega Team. <em>We've been on the Rikti world ever since the gateway was sealed. <em>We snuck into a shipment meant for this place. <em>We were hunting Dra'Gon, the twisted War Lineage scientist. <em>So let's get him."

