// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3264501365" "You were unable to successfully complete your mission."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P435115683" "<color deepskyblue>LADY GREY TASKFORCE:  'The Dragon'<br>Part: Three<br><br></color>You have performed more than just a great victory today, but indeed, you have brought forth a triumph! The return of members of the <color deepskyblue>Omega Team</color>, and the information they carry is being analyzed already. We are, of course, using all resources at our disposal to ensure that this is no deception. <br><br>However, despite your victories, the Rikti have not ceased their machinations and we have learned from Miss Yin's precognitions that the Invaders will soon begin an even more desperate and nefarious operation!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3661362983" "<color deepskyblue>LADY GREY TASKFORCE:  'The Dragon'<br>Part: Three<br><br></color>We are disappointed in this outcome, but a great deal has still been learned. In particular, the information not only that the <color deepskyblue>Omega Team</color> still operates on the Rikti Homeworld is most important. Even now, we are attempting to ascertain the truth of the information they sacrificed so much to bring us. If it is true, it will be grim tidings indeed. <br><br>However, there is little time to rest. We have learned from Miss Yin's precognitions that the Invaders will soon begin an even more desperate and nefarious operation!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P671643570" "<color deepskyblue>LADY GREY TASKFORCE:  'The Beast and the Sea' <br>Part: Four<br><br></color>Miss Yin, whom you may remember, has foreseen that the Rikti plan one last desperate gamble to stabilize the gateway between our worlds, that they might flood the full power of their armed forces through once more. <br><br>Miss Yin's precognitions have shown us that they will attempt to harness the power of the <color red>Hamidon</color>, as it occurs in the Rogue Isles. They must be stopped, and doubly so! <color orange>For the power of the Hamidon may also be the key to defeating a great and insurmountable foe</color>, should that foe successfully take the field."
// AcceptString :
"P124238291" "Stop Rikti Hamidon Raid"
// SendOffString :
"P995694804" "<color deepskyblue>LADY GREY TASKFORCE:  'The Beast and the Sea' <br>Part: Four<br><br></color>Your goal shall be two-fold. Firstly, you are to <color orange>defeat the Rikti, and destroy the Power Spires</color> they are using to transmit the Hamidon's energy back to their ship. <br><br>Secondly, once the spires are down you must defeat the <color red>Hamidon</color> in its weakened state. The power you harvest from it could be needed to tip a crucial balance should the worst come to pass..."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P37965844" "Defeat the Hamidon"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1526200197" "<color deepskyblue>LADY GREY TASKFORCE:  'The Beast and the Sea' <br>Part: Four<br><br></color>Once the Rikti are dealt with, the <color red>Hamidon</color> should still be weakened. You should stand a decent chance at defeating it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3113100457" "You exit the chopper on the edge of the Abyss, the hole in the sea where the Hamidon rips through into our reality."

