// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2386841491" "<color deepskyblue>LADY GREY TASKFORCE:  'Apocalypse' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>The Rikti are preparing to open a single gateway long enough to bring forth <color red>The Honoree</color>. IF they should succeed, they will bring the most powerful warrior they have at their disposal directly into our dimension. <br><br>This cannot be allowed! Thus, I charge you, {TaskForceName}, in the name of the Vanguard and all the peoples of Earth, to stop the Rikti!"
// AcceptString :
"P3743263311" "Stop the Rikti"
// SendOffString :
"P516010104" "<color deepskyblue>LADY GREY TASKFORCE:  'Apocalypse' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>You will have three tasks ahead of you: <br><br>Firstly, you must <color orange>defeat Hro'Dtohz</color>, the Lord of the Rikti Lineage of War. He will be on-site overseeing the portal's activation.<br><br>Secondly, you must <color orange>destroy the portal generators</color> that keep the portal stable. Doing so will ruin all of their work and destabilize the conduit between worlds once more. <br><br>Finally, if the worst should happen, and <color red>The Honoree</color> should reach our world, <color orange>you must defeat him</color>. I can tell you no more, for it is our hope that it shall not come to pass. If it does not, you need know no more. If it does, you will understand my recalcitrance. Should the need arise, we have prepared the power of the Hamidon into a form that should help against him. Pray you need not use it."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4132073210" "Stop the Honoree"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3737998301" "<color deepskyblue>LADY GREY TASKFORCE:  'Apocalypse' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>You know your objectives. There is little use left in discussion when action must be taken. Good luck upon you all. Your bravery has been truly inspirational."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1834309829" "The Rikti have spent a great deal of effort building this portal chamber beneath their ship. Time to make sure it doesn't pay off!"

