"P3251290452" "You have stopped the Rikti's plans for now. Return to Lady Grey for further instructions."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2691597314" "<color deepskyblue>LADY GREY TASKFORCE:  'Apocalypse' <br>Part: Finale<br><br></color>So, it was true. The Rikti's <color red>Honoree</color> was our own <color deepskyblue>Hero 1</color>, taken from us, transformed, and mind-controlled by the Invader. <br><br>Let us not mourn for his fall, for even with all the alien science bent to break his will, he fought to retain some of his humanity. Perhaps one day, he can be restored. If that day comes, it will be because of your bravery and valor. <br><br>Though tinged with sorrow, this is indeed a moment of triumph, your moment of triumph. For you have fought against all odds and saved all of us, and may now stand with your heads held high amongst your peers, here in this City of Heroes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
